# party.pdl - the roster of the island pets and what each looks like. The core reads columns 1-3 (name, sheet, index); the skin reads the rest.
# PET | name | sheet | index | art id | letter | red | green | blue | spawn x | spawn y
#   sheet, index : the generated character sheet the pet wears (!edit0 holds pets 1-8, !edit1 pets 9-16; the skin writes them, 48 px cells, one picture in every direction)
#   art id       : art/<art id>.csv (a pals sprite.csv copy, 64x64); none = the pet is a coloured disc
#   letter       : one character for the map legend; red, green, blue: the disc colour (an art pet's average replaces it)
#   spawn        : the first-run cell on the main island (the island south of the cabin)
